# 💪 Built Different — Personal Fitness Brand Website

> *"Fitness is not a hobby. It's a lifestyle."*

A cinematic, dark-themed personal brand website for a serious gym enthusiast. Built with pure HTML, CSS, and JavaScript — no frameworks.

---

## 🔗 Live Demo

https://adorable-tulumba-eda64d.netlify.app/

---

