---

## 📁 Project Structure

```
built-different/
├── index.html        # Main HTML file
├── style.css         # All styles
├── script.js         # Scroll animations & interactions
└── images/
    ├── hero.png      # Hero background
    ├── profile.png   # Profile photo
    └── gallery.png   # Gallery image
```

---

## 🧩 Sections

| Section | Description |
|---|---|
| **Hero** | Full-screen banner with glitch text effect |
| **About** | Personal story and training background |
| **Stats** | PR numbers — Bench, Squat, Deadlift |
| **Philosophy** | Training principles and mindset |
| **Split** | 6-day Push/Pull/Legs workout plan |
| **Nutrition** | Macros and daily supplement stack |
| **Gallery** | Training photo grid |
| **Contact** | Message form + social links |

---

## ⚙️ Tech Stack

- **HTML5** — Semantic structure
- **CSS3** — Custom properties, Grid, Flexbox, animations
- **Vanilla JavaScript** — Scroll reveal, hamburger menu
- **Google Fonts** — Bebas Neue + Inter

---

## 🌐 Deployment

Works on any static host:

- **Netlify** — Drag and drop the folder at [netlify.com](https://netlify.com)

---

## ✏️ Customization

| What to change | Where |
|---|---|
| Name / brand | `index.html` → navbar logo & footer |
| PR numbers | `index.html` → `#stats` section |
| Workout split | `index.html` → `#split` section |
| Macros | `index.html` → `#nutrition` section |
| Colors / fonts | `style.css` → CSS variables at top |
| Photos | Replace files inside `/images/` |

